	<object class="Event" id="{842f1abc-2d95-4ed8-8414-0c78390ba863}">
		<property name="note">
			<value>Music_Level1 - one music event for the whole level, plays from level start
and keeps running. Driven by two GLOBAL parameters:

MusicState (labeled) - priority: Boss &gt; BossDefeated &gt; zone
  Main         - default; anywhere outside a music zone
  Zone01       - zone near the start (was Atmos_Overground_02)
  Zone02       - large zone, west-middle of Level1 (was Atmos_Overground_03)
  Zone03       - small zone nested inside Zone02 (was Atmos_Overground_01)
  Boss         - while the Grenadier is aware of Ellen (within 40 m);
                 overrides any zone
  BossDefeated - for N seconds after the Grenadier dies, then back to the
                 current zone. N = Grenadier prefab &gt; Grenadier Behaviour &gt;
                 Boss Defeated Music Time (default 10 s)

CombatIntensity (continuous, 0-10) - number of enemies currently aware of
  Ellen (Chompers from spotting her until they lose her; Grenadier counts 1).
  Whole steps, raw count: use seek speed / hold so it doesn't flicker.

Notes: zone sizes are a bit odd in Level1 (awkward switch back to Main near
the last switch). Debug readout bottom-left in play mode shows MusicState
and CombatIntensity. Test scene: zones behind the door, Chompers west,
Grenadier east.
</value>
		</property>
